## Describe your changes and why you are making these changes
This PR adds a route `api/artifact/{artfId}/results` to list all historical results given an artifact ID. It reuses `RawResultResponse` object introduced in #425 . For small artifacts like `bool`, `string` and `numeric`, we also include the artifacts' value as response.

This route will be immediately used to fetch metrics / check history for UI redesign.

## Related issue number (if any)
ENG-1570

